### ─── FUNCTIONAL ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [F] GET /api/me — z tokenem (200)
GET {{baseUrlFunctional}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [F] GET /api/me — bez tokenu (401)
GET {{baseUrlFunctional}}/api/me

### [F] GET /api/me — zły token (401)
GET {{baseUrlFunctional}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer bad-token

### ─── OOP ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [O] GET /api/me — z tokenem (200)
GET {{baseUrlOop}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [O] GET /api/me — bez tokenu (401)
GET {{baseUrlOop}}/api/me

### [O] GET /api/me — zły token (401)
GET {{baseUrlOop}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer bad-token
